WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
I can pretend to disagree

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,360
then you threaten me

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:04,520
As long as your master, that old antique, won't blame me

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,520
There's also a plot involved

5
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,960
Then I have lived for hundreds of years

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,720
Wouldn't it be boring if you don't cultivate some clothes?

7
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:28,370
senior sister

8
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:29,850
Gu Chen is already over a hundred years old

9
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:31,450
Then this woman is older than Gu Chen

10
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,700
He still looks like he's eighteen years old

11
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:34,780
Introduce yourself

12
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:35,780
My name is Xiangxiang

13
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,140
She is Xiao Guchen’s senior sister

14
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,420
But you are not allowed to call me uncle

15
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,820
Call me old

16
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:42,620
This Vincent is so handsome Kaka

17
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:46,220
Can you peel it off and give it to me as a meeting gift? No.
